11, 2026 - Veterans Day \nWednesday, November 25, 2026 - Closing at Noon \nThursday and Friday, November 26 and 27, 2026 - Thanksgiving Holiday \nThursday, December 24, 2026 - Closing at Noon \nFriday, December 25, 2026 - Christmas Day \nStaff Contacts \nJulianna Hale, Town Clerk/Tax Collector \nKari Bodycote, Deputy Town Clerk \nKelly Acheson, Assistant Town Clerk \nDianna LeBlanc, Assistant Town Clerk \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tJulianna Hale\r\nTown Clerk/Tax Collector \r\nTown Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t Town Hall \n\t\t\t\t\t\t 19 Academy Avenue \n\t\t\t\t\t Atkinson ,  NH   03811 \r\nTown Hall 19 Academy Avenue Atkinson NH 03811 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\nPhone:  603-362-4920 \r\nFax: 603-362-5305 \r\nHours \nMonday:  8:30 am to 5 pm \nTuesday:  8:30 am to 6:30 pm \nWednesdays & Thursdays:  8:30 am to 5 pm \nFridays:  8 am to 12 pm \r\nDirectory \r\nFAQs \r\n             How do I obtain a birth/death/marriage/divorce certificate? \r\n             Can I get married at the Town Hall? \r\n             How are car registration fees calculated and what do I need to register my vehicle? \r\n             How do I re-title and move the registration of my vehicles from my personal name to a Trust? \r\n             Do you accept credit and debit cards? What forms of payment do you accept? \r\n         View All FAQs \r\n/FAQ.aspx \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Applications & \nLicenses \r\n\t\t\t Minutes, Agendas & Public Notices \r\n\t\t\t Department Hours \r\n\t\t\t Property Taxes \r\n\t\t\t Trash & Recycling \r\nTown of Atkinson \r\n19 Academy Avenue \r\nAtkinson, NH 03811 \r\nPhone:  603-362-5266 \r\n         Job Opportunities \n         Volunteer Opportunities \n         Subscribe \n         Elections \n         Photos \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n         Home \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Site Map \n         Copyright Notices \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
